    "rich_text_3hNNBB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_dQtMJt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is a 10,000mAh Power Bank Right for Your Daily Life?",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_tBPf9i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All-day power, shrunk to fit your palm. RORRY’s <strong>10,000mAh power banks</strong> offer the ultimate sweet spot: enough capacity to charge your iPhone 16 Pro nearly twice, packed into a lightweight design that won't weigh down your purse or pocket. Stay connected in style from morning meetings to late-night travel.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_kMa6xy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Golden Ratio of Capacity: Why 10,000mAh is the Sweet Spot",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_N8dXxh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A woman's handbag is her daily sanctuary, containing everything from lipsticks to planners. Why should your backup power look like a heavy, industrial black brick? When searching for the <strong>best 10000mah power bank</strong>, you are looking for the perfect intersection of lightweight portability and worry-free capacity. 5,000mAh is excellent for an hour of emergency boost, but a power bank of 10000mah is what actually gets you through a long weekend without anxiety.<br/><br/>Our signature <a href=\"/products/rorry-d2-10000mah-pd-20w-portable-charger-keychain-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY CharmGo D2-10000mAh Portable Charger Keychain Power Bank 20W\"><strong>RORRY CharmGo D2 (10,000mAh)</strong></a> and <a href=\"/products/rorry-charmgo-d4-10000mah-portable-charger-keychainpower-bank-45w\" title=\"RORRY CharmGo D4-10000mAh Portable Charger Keychain Power Bank 45W\"><strong>CharmGo D4 series</strong></a> prove that high capacity doesn’t have to mean clutter. We've packed premium, high-density battery cells into a tiny, charm-inspired keychain chassis that is barely larger than a credit card. It is the best 10000mah power bank for keeping your iPhone 16 Pro and Apple Watch Series 10 charged simultaneously during a full day of sightseeing, eliminating the need to pack multiple tangled cords.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_ntNqjr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ditch the Cables: The Magic of Built-In AC Plugs and Wires",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_Kte9W9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you've ever arrived at a hotel room or an airport terminal only to realize you've forgotten your wall adapter, you know how frustrating traveling can be. Our <a href=\"/products/rorry-flow-cb4-10000mah-portable-charger-charging-with-cable-wall-plug-40w\" title=\"RORRY Flow CB4-10000mAh Portable Charger Charging with Cable & Wall Plug 40W\"><strong>RORRY Flow CB4</strong></a> and <a href=\"/products/rorry-cb06-10000mah-portable-charger-fast-charging-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY CB06 10000mAh Portable Charger(AC Wall Plug 22.5W)\"><strong>CB06</strong></a> series are designed to be the ultimate portable 10000mah power bank solutions for frequent flyers. Featuring integrated folding AC prongs and built-in cables, they act as both a wall plug and a portable battery.<br/><br/>You can charge your devices directly from the outlet, and when it’s time to move, simply unplug and carry the power with you. This streamlined convenience is why our community of over 150,000 users consistently rates the Flow series as the best power bank 10000mah option for travel.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_xmfHbT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "MagSafe & Minimalism: Thinner Than Your Compact Mirror",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_Fjjcig": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For daily commutes and coffee shop sessions, your charger should be as discreet as possible. If you prefer a cable-free experience, the <a href=\"/products/rorry-d14-10000mah-ultra-slim-magsafe-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY D14-10000mAh Ultra Slim Magsafe Power Bank\"><strong>RORRY D14 Ultra Slim MagSafe Power Bank</strong></a> and the P1 series with integrated phone rings are your perfect match. these magnetic wireless power banks 10000mah snap seamlessly to the back of your iPhone without blocking your camera lens.<br/><br/>Crafted with a sophisticated leather-grain finish that is incredibly soft to the touch, it feels like a luxury accessory rather than an electronic tool. It’s an ultra thin polymer power bank 10000mah design that slides easily into a small clutch or a coat pocket, ensuring your phone stays powered while you snap photos or navigate a new city.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_kFHLVF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "From Bedside to Bag: The 3-in-1 Desktop Charging Station",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_AFC8xX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Your charging routine shouldn't stop when you get home. RORRY’s innovation extends to your nightstand and office setup. Our <a href=\"/products/rorry-m3-10000mah-foldable-charger-magsafe-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY M3 10000mAh Magsafe Charging Station\"><strong>RORRY M3</strong></a> and <a href=\"/products/rorry-3-in-1-charger-10000mah-with-charging-station-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY M4-5000mAh M5-10000mAh 3 in 1 Charger with Wireless Charging Station Power Bank\"><strong>M4/M5 series</strong></a> act as <a href=\"/collections/wireless-chargers\" title=\"Wireless Charger\"><strong>3 in 1 wireless charging stations</strong></a> that double as portable battery packs. When docked, they keep your desk beautifully organized and clutter-free, charging your iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods wirelessly.<br/><br/>When you need to leave, simply slide the battery pack out of the dock—now you have a <strong>wireless power bank 10000mah</strong> ready for your handbag. Experience the seamless transition of power designed specifically to fit your modern, fast-paced lifestyle.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
